msgid "1 audio or video file (subfolders included)"
msgstr "1 аудио- или видеофайл (включая подпапки)"

msgid "1 transcription"
msgstr "1 транскрипция"

msgid "A YouTube video or a direct link to an audio or video file."
msgstr "Видео с YouTube или прямая ссылка на аудио- или видеофайл."

msgid ""
"A fast model writes a draft while you speak. When you stop, the whole "
"recording is transcribed again with the model of the engine, which is "
"more accurate."
